    "long_instructions": "# Debug a Game Loop\r\n\r\nYou're a Game Engineer reviewing AI-generated code for a power-up system. The AI wrote the Speed Boost loop, but something is wrong.\r\n\r\nThe player just grabbed a Speed Boost. Each second:\r\n- the boost stays active\r\n- the timer should tick down by 1\r\n- the player keeps moving faster\r\n\r\nThe loop should stop when the timer reaches 0. Then the boost should wear off and the player should return to normal speed.\r\n\r\n**Your job:** Run the code and use the Debugging Checklist to find what is wrong. Fix the loop so the timer counts down correctly and the boost wears off when it should.",
    "display_name": "Speed Boost Power Up",
    "bubble_choice_description": "The power up never stops due to a buggy loop!",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/97c4594d3c41344ea398a6b5f1888df5-Screenshot 2026-06-02 131002.png"
